{"contentuid": "h77c7453e87784f8697a01fda15223678cg9d", "version": 2, "source": "He did the only thing he could, because he didn't know the truth. That's Mizora's doing, not yours.", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "h1c751c654e944f25988c455a22d32d2e12e8", "version": 2, "source": "I... You're right.", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "h6cf243ffc2ca456fa102e12cff7d99af96af", "version": 2, "source": "...That <i>wretch.</i>", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "h82ed2791b89744a3ad1fa1681f0e685b03c5", "version": 2, "source": "I'm so sorry, Wyll. None of this should have ever happened to you.", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "h9a31d1f5e4d546bbb71f9b1d9454a1849164", "version": 2, "source": "Ah... Thank you.", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "h85f711a152cd455788ad4deff749d3c13529", "version": 2, "source": "You're incredibly kind.", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "h39f4ab6821e843699d5bed349948c2f56bdf", "version": 2, "source": "But, not always.", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "h09b455c781e44edb9059d6d8376ead0dbcbc", "version": 2, "source": "The moment I pacted myself to Mizora I have not regretted for a heartbeat.", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "h2f8d8692c05a4b50b0f31b6e3a1c0eb9a5f2", "version": 2, "source": "...And, given the circumstance... I'd do it again.", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "h400485aefff849d9916f0108d25d3ffdf748", "version": 2, "source": "What would you most like to do, when your pact is broken?", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "h386a271befde49f29891a9a76578f42e754f", "version": 2, "source": "I've had so little time to stop and notice life's small wonders.", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "h85f8963cfaec4f8baae6c3b584b9107795cf", "version": 2, "source": "If I ever manage to break this pact...", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "h20b222d1bdd9456b934ef868e876ddef54dg", "version": 2, "source": "I want to instill hope. Hope for a bountiful future.", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "h62d5075353df4d3e8402496ed0284712f4d7", "version": 2, "source": "A story worth telling.", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "hf2523bf691b74f2f80c8a136e4c333c0gg49", "version": 2, "source": "A life worth living.", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "hf9bf02e39f5b45d58ca25983fc8fe24d36f0", "version": 2, "source": "I'd like that.", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "h19d0b9cf45a1445b880ad6a831a7c9d799ee", "version": 2, "source": "Maybe what you did was right, but you've more than paid your due. It's time you got your freedom.", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "hd1f65e34e10b46a49b762a4072a495418d42", "version": 2, "source": "I know sacrifice. My soul was a necessary price to pay in the grand scheme of things.", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "hd890003bce7542938b7ee773b41006ccd2d2", "version": 2, "source": "...But I was afraid, too.", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "he77848290cf34d86863de5eaff289c67d9d6", "version": 2, "source": "This pact...", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "hd553415eb5c2452690a0e3f747ce165bg247", "version": 2, "source": "Can't <i>wait</i> to leave it behind for good.", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "h855359daed504a7dbce599ef95d8b7e45f6g", "version": 4, "source": "Damn it. It can never be easy, can it?", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "h6b46db263c1f40848394835e0072d0f1be2a", "version": 2, "source": "You deserve to be protected too, Wyll.", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "hc2c7b65c31004208b4743494cacb1f4e08dd", "version": 2, "source": "I - I don't know what to say.", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "h3f90aea7349b4596a2322cdf825176e59194", "version": 2, "source": "Part of me wants to deny the claim.", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "hf8a8224e08c74fe3bb0883ad3ac769f6g62a", "version": 2, "source": "But I can't. Not when I know deep down that you're right.", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "h5a64436edcf944ada19464b6d2d5df73cg07", "version": 2, "source": "Thank you.", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "h3c070da3207c4d8f9f1fc435625fb7d31fga", "version": 2, "source": "You shouldn't have to shoulder the fate of the city alone.", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "hb7c3c3e768034d468322eec7c701ca5c6756", "version": 2, "source": "I admit...it pains me to hear you say it.", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "h1bbb885a10b04ff08fecc2fbb1ac8894c76b", "version": 2, "source": "<i>'You don't have to shoulder this burden alone.'</i>", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "h0e4f1fa92ebb4bc3b9dcf69dc2680f936gc2", "version": 2, "source": "It's a complicated matter.", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "h7482ee6f83574501bacb807ccc0f300ee485", "version": 2, "source": "My soul lies with the city. And the city's wounds still bleed.", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "h2c61d87cac6f4b0da38391154992db59f11c", "version": 2, "source": "Are you ready to be their hero...?", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "hf5e1454260b24f0eacce8e8e51cda15575gc", "version": 2, "source": "Well then - with you as my ally, the future looks a little less daunting.", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "h8b291fc5a10e4fc38ea2c45156200482799a", "version": 2, "source": "Without you at my side, this city wouldn't shine half as bright.", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "h16d6839a73c94a4981df58af45f00e8a0e74", "version": 2, "source": "I still can't believe you pulled that stunt - calling yourself 'Zariel's asset.' I'm glad Wyll saw through the lie.", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "hf3d96e10178a40b595863ac5f644cfe2da82", "version": 2, "source": "Fine. What happens next?", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "h2bcc6142309c45e0a72d09ce0a8c258ebd2d", "version": 2, "source": "Break the pact. Think about what Zariel will do - your pact will give her a foothold in Baldur's gate.", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "h231b584a08974cb98ab7be8b92bf910df1ec", "version": 2, "source": "Break the pact, Wyll - please. You deserve your freedom. You always have.", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "h4e7e18f8dc924db5bdb064860c2a35b40b3a", "version": 2, "source": "I don't think you have a choice, Wyll. Your father's life is at stake. Keep the pact.", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "h518511756eb240b59689d419be2730daag7f", "version": 2, "source": "<i>Say nothing - let Wyll decide.</i>", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "h8b37f4d729ea488097b4e7dd1073ca36f1eg", "version": 2, "source": "<i>Give Wyll a reassuring nod. This is his choice. You don't get to make it for him.</i>", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "haf6330611c5f4667beb73d8b82a455dc3agg", "version": 2, "source": "<i>STOP!</i>", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "h6d8b0eeb1849489f900c170e9c34094c67gf", "version": 2, "source": "You need to understand...", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "h7bc144ff5cf541f2afc41488cfe1b6978d9f", "version": 2, "source": "My father's <i>life</i> is at stake.", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "hfaafcf0cff634d31b0c285b4b569a46f5e00", "version": 2, "source": "I know this is my doing, my choice, my burden, but -", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "h20d35f82169b4cd0b2c952eb9c3fcf7da521", "version": 2, "source": "...You're right.", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "h8d7a21c4c17244b89eafc75d10d9a1862ae5", "version": 2, "source": "...But who am I fooling.", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "hf1aabb64bec84300a7739b1e90bfe862g623", "version": 2, "source": "I know this is my doing, my choice, my burden... But the thought of him laying there, lifeless...", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "h544c4deda14c4449bae35b15ba4f39f35g1g", "version": 2, "source": "I know when I'm being led down a dark path.", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "haf843bd0826546a5b9feb488459eea866a89", "version": 2, "source": "...But who am I fooling. I can't go back to that life.", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "h9236ede4fda24077800076f97e655d44a357", "version": 2, "source": "Seven years. Seven years of hunting the monsters of the Sword Coast - and seven years of Mizora's tight leash.", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "ha521c10bf03f40d78dc7b173528cbeeb30a1", "version": 2, "source": "And seven years of wondering if I'd ever rid myself of her - or if I even should.", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "h00c12525ab05488f80b0cb09f6cf7274f9e7", "version": 2, "source": "...But everything's <i>changed.</i>", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "h68af0cb012a949ef820bc8037e290a6327c1", "version": 2, "source": "I am a new man.", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "hfea980155c2e4f9887d56d9216385089e8dc", "version": 2, "source": "A different time, a different Blade.", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "h98280bfd4bab42e49c5ab74e4975a0e76a33", "version": 2, "source": "I can't go back to that life.", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "h598e94787ce44f389b3cd40992770439b026", "version": 2, "source": "I'm responsible for Baldur's Gate. She needs me - <i>desperately,</i> now more than ever. I can't abandon her.", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "h009f2f044b6f4135a78c9996dcf56588dg50", "version": 2, "source": "It was my father who taught me the ways of the just.", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "h4e063458dc264322916195900f74c1759ccd", "version": 2, "source": "We did not see eye to eye. But his every thought, every act, was in service to his people. Among men, there was none greater.", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "h22c5fa21d7884ab2b85d390893b21e590bae", "version": 2, "source": "Everything I did, I did for Baldur's Gate.", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "h4b16819b0af54fb79ff4fa3c0a738f52cd5f", "version": 2, "source": "Father... I'm so sorry...", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "h15e3da15c51645b08a536692cfab9fd63c5f", "version": 1, "source": "Mizora - <i>I've had enough</i>. You promised my freedom.", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "ha4a871b7790b43cea05d229272450a4121c8", "version": 2, "source": "I'm responsible for Baldur's Gate. She needs me - <i>desperately,</i> now more than ever.", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "h30616eabc3574c26b5364d28dcdee43c6073", "version": 2, "source": "I can't abandon her.", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "h467066cfefa5423f8b9605dfec1716c494fe", "version": 2, "source": "We did not see eye to eye. But his every thought, every act, was in service to his people.", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "hae88ca7c8a6945cdaa8d0ed56b85cc26g7d5", "version": 2, "source": "Among men, there was none greater.", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "h210b02b0ffe14b88b5ecee34615ea08af6be", "version": 2, "source": "She'll be gone soon, thankfully. Do this mission, and Mizora will free you from the pact. I'll be glad to see the day.", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "hf511ad56759d4d09acf61b4ec92239ed6ged", "version": 2, "source": "What happens if we just leave her there?", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "h92cba368c7824436b990cd9c9ddd25e75576", "version": 2, "source": "Don't apologize. This is about you - not me. You're the only one who matters here.", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "hfb4ed952f04e4662b634f1d1f1449de15266", "version": 2, "source": "We'll find a way. You're not alone in this, all right?", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "hb30c8cdd33b84039b0d67c77149c853900dc", "version": 2, "source": "Don't worry, Wyll. We'll show that dickhead <i>exactly</i> where she can stick her contract - just you see.", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "h75ded72bbf41401ab7b38555feb331414f48", "version": 2, "source": "I'm sure we'll figure <i>something</i> out. I've always wanted to kill a devil - don't you dare leave me out of it.", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "hb97dc9c1b6f24c178dce41342aad9e3b2f8b", "version": 2, "source": "We will get <i>nowhere</i> by doubting our abilities. We'll see this devil speared by a silver sword soon enough.", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "h103dd0bbfdb544ebb4c82138767680a02afg", "version": 2, "source": "I'm certain we'll get you out of this. I'd even bet my tower in Waterdeep on it - and I don't intend to give <i>that</i> up anytime soon.", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "h76510046bc0a4b3db66539a7f484a2f88868", "version": 2, "source": "Who's to say we won't out-bargain her? She's got to have some weakness. Even a devil will break if you instill enough fear and self-doubt.", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "hb5c0ecff349f4ea192b721a6181bb824685f", "version": 2, "source": "So, let's out-bargain her, then. Sometimes a silver tongue is all you need - and then we can start talking <i>actual</i> knives.", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "h3dfc20927c504d4dbb6d4c831d27007fcac6", "version": 2, "source": "I refuse to let this devil win.", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "h6df2175ae85d4251ae673371712afe4e3d5d", "version": 2, "source": "I've been through something similar before, with my own abuser. I'm so sorry you have to feel like this, too.", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "h8d4a19c805a044f9ade08aaf1719f3f50ec2", "version": 2, "source": "There must be some loophole in the contract that lets you out. No one deserves this abuse.", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "hed984ce34b004547aff32fa9492e631461c6", "version": 2, "source": "I spent so long dealing with Zariel's abuse - and Mizora had a front-row seat to all of it. I can't just sit by and watch her hurt you, too.", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "ha6f60a40247441b29cde7ed364e7b57fd022", "version": 2, "source": "Abusers always seem to know what'll keep you stuck, don't they? I'm so sorry, Wyll. I felt the same way with my ex.", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "h15850299541e480ab66da014c8bb263d225d", "version": 2, "source": "I'm sorry.", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "h481c8eb4bebd43ba8505125b099bc7231142", "version": 2, "source": "How glad I am that you see me as more than my patron's pet.", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "h6c71274443024cbeb1866cca85eb6bc6f1g7", "version": 2, "source": "I'm not sure that I am. But it means something that you think so.", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "h506d2b4fbd31455491d00c37c4718eed28ea", "version": 2, "source": "What are you...?", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "hada3fa9b430c43e5bd2f26f7ddc6f9ac55e2", "version": 2, "source": "You end it. No more pact, no more debt. <i>Then</i> I set you free - and you flit back to Zariel and leave me for good.", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "h79c8d80fac71446f921649e1f5e06f62531a", "version": 2, "source": "Mizora? <i>You're</i> Zariel's asset?", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "h730a101b3c5546f9b0ab57d499b21c7cgc9e", "version": 2, "source": "Don't <i>set her off.</i>", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "h3ad4879a7ecb424cbf36ceb48ccbbad4ac1c", "version": 2, "source": "*Wyll catches his breath.*", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "hfe81eb49871b4a0ba9c17d960a73b48d5439", "version": 2, "source": "*Your parasites connect. Your minds intertwine...*", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "h87a6eff94a954ec0961602150978ee7e9595", "version": 2, "source": "*Your right eye <i>vibrates</i>...*", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "h6e2e25bb93bb42f899d2af288834b9574b9c", "version": 2, "source": "*Suddenly, you see what she sees - a pulsing red cluster of organs.*", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "h5fbb6605a8de4ac48dc742d8c10db2e8b2ga", "version": 2, "source": "*You see dark tunnels lit by noxious pools of brine.*", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
{"contentuid": "he0d11aca03b041df8c98819e1313ce7bd003", "version": 2, "source": "*You see a clawed hand open a holding pod...*", "file": "Localization/English/MGNTN_WyllPactPoints.loca.xml"}
